      \spii Format: \headstyle{font=F,scale=S,track=T,deco=D,case=C}^^J%%
      \spiv F -> One of the Novelette 'font codes'. Default main.^^J%%
      \spix Default main.^^J%%
      \spiv S -> Decimal number 0.83-1. Default 0.93.^^J%%
      \spiv T -> Integer 0-9. Tracking, from tight to very loose. Default 2.^^J%%
      \spiv D -> bar bullet square lozenge dash none. Default none.^^J%%
      \spix Some layouts over-ride the choice for D.^^J%%
      \spiv C -> head titl smcp onum smon none. Ignored unless font=main.^^J%%
